r linking feature and hit \"Publish\" to share your experiences with your friends and family or with potential customers or clients. Anything is possible with Driftspace!", "short_description": "Welcome to Driftspace! Driftspace is a platform for creating immersive VR stories by combining 360 video, text, images, links, and other media. Driftspace allows you to create interactive video stories in VR and to share them with others, as well as to browse the drifts made by others. Driftspace also support a real-time social VR experience, letting you experience your content with anyone in the world! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AAChQHnjiBj9LU7lmfVd8n1sO097asLc/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/13L1qPdRgaQ0nb7UGnJ-EmNExW4dRyc2W/view?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "The Yarn Corporation", "support_website_url": "https://dashboard.driftspace.com/", "website_url": "https://driftspace.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "SOCIAL", "ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP", "MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "626155265336652"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "284691570060095"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "284691570060095"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1